/* Native ST 1.18 popup contract: data-id + the original body/controls tree.
   There is no DOM type attribute. This structural scope admits text, a one-row
   main textarea and native checkbox options in content or popup-inputs. Text
   semantics, passive lists and inline avatar summaries remain simple content;
   interactive forms, general media, custom actions, crops and large editors
   retain their host layout. Inline visibility wins.
   @scope also excludes extension-owned lookalike components; extensions that
   call the native Popup API follow the same structural rules as core callers. */
